ider_protocol_error, never with a partial result. The production\n+// entry point is DecodeResponse.\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"internal/provhost/protocol_test.go","added":51,"removed":3},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
